      "applicability": "Rendered form elements owning at least one enabled control (HTML form owner, including the form attribute).",
      "expectation": "Needs review when a form has controls but no enabled submit control (button\nwithout type or type=submit, input submit/image, role=button marked as\nsubmit): without one, a change may submit the form. 3.2.2 fails only on an\nactual change of context, so never a confirmed violation; without action\nand without text field (toggles changing the page) the review has low\nseverity. A submit button outside the form with form=... counts; a form with\nonly hidden inputs is not judged.",
      "method": "shared",
      "capabilities": [
        "dom"
      ],
      "page_level": false,
      "failing": {
        "case": "form_toggles_without_submit",
        "file": "tests/fixtures/detection_corpus/form_toggles_without_submit.html",
        "verdict": "needs_review",
        "selector": "form#toggles",
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<!-- form-no-submit (#728): a form of toggles without action, text field or\n     submit control only changes content on the page (here via CSS :has()),\n     so it is a review note, not a 3.2.2 violation. A form with an action and\n     no submit control stays a violation. -->\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Form of toggles without submit</title>\n<style>\n  /* #783: page shell, so the case only reports what it is about */\n  .skip, nav a { display: inline-block; padding: 12px; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  button, input, select, textarea { min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  input[type=\"checkbox\"], input[type=\"radio\"] { width: 44px; height: 44px; }\n</style>\n  <style>\n    body:has(#t-contrast:checked) .demo { color: #777; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to main content</a>\n<header><p>Example Shop</p><nav aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a> <a href=\"/help\">Help</a></nav></header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n    <h1>Demo</h1>\n    <form id=\"toggles\">\n      <fieldset>\n        <legend>Remove accessibility</legend>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"t-labels\"><label for=\"t-labels\">Remove labels</label>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"t-contrast\"><label for=\"t-contrast\">Remove contrast</label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"size\" id=\"t-small\"><label for=\"t-small\">Small</label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"size\" id=\"t-large\"><label for=\"t-large\">Large</label>\n      </fieldset>\n      <button type=\"reset\">Reset</button>\n    </form>\n    <p class=\"demo\">Sample text.</p>\n    <form id=\"filter\" action=\"/results\">\n      <fieldset>\n        <legend>Filter</legend>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f-open\" name=\"open\"><label for=\"f-open\">Open only</label>\n      </fieldset>\n    </form>\n  </main>\n<footer><p>Example Shop, 2026</p></footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
      "passing": {
        "case": "forms_submit_redundant",
        "file": "tests/fixtures/detection_corpus/forms_submit_redundant.html",
        "verdict": "absent",
        "selector": "form#with-btn",
        "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Order forms</title>\n<style>\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #222; background: #fff; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 16px; }\n  a { color: #0050a0; }\n  .skip, nav a, .solo { display: inline-block; padding: 12px; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  button, input, select, textarea, [role=\"button\"], [role=\"textbox\"], [role=\"radio\"], [role=\"link\"], [role=\"searchbox\"] {\n    display: inline-block; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 1rem; }\n  input[type=\"checkbox\"], input[type=\"radio\"] { width: 44px; height: 44px; }\n  .visually-hidden { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to main content</a>\n<header><p>Example Shop</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a> <a href=\"/help\">Help</a></nav>\n</header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<h1>Order forms</h1>\n<!-- G2 #783: forms with and without a submit control (H32, 3.2.2) and forms asking for the same information twice (3.3.7) with the exceptions: confirmation, autofill, a same-as option, a single request. -->\n<form id=\"no-btn\" action=\"/subscribe\" method=\"post\">\n  <p><label for=\"ns-mail\">Email for the price alert</label> <input id=\"ns-mail\" name=\"alert\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></p>\n</form>\n<form id=\"with-btn\" action=\"/subscribe\" method=\"post\">\n  <p><label for=\"wb-mail\">Email for the newsletter</label> <input id=\"wb-mail\" name=\"news\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"> <button type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button></p>\n</form>\n<form id=\"ext-btn\" action=\"/notify\" method=\"post\">\n  <p><label for=\"eb-mail\">Email for restock notices</label> <input id=\"eb-mail\" name=\"restock\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></p>\n</form>\n<p><button type=\"submit\" form=\"ext-btn\">Notify me</button></p>\n<form id=\"aria-submit\" action=\"/callback\" method=\"post\">\n  <p><label for=\"as-time\">Preferred call time</label> <input id=\"as-time\" name=\"slot\" type=\"text\" aria-describedby=\"as-hint\"> <span id=\"as-hint\">For example: mornings.</span></p>\n  <p><span role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Send request\" data-submit onclick=\"this.closest('form').requestSubmit()\" onkeydown=\"if (event.key === 'Enter' || event.key === ' ') this.closest('form').requestSubmit()\">Send request</span></p>\n</form>\n<form id=\"empty-form\" action=\"/ping\" method=\"post\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ping\" value=\"1\"><p>Nothing to fill in here.</p></form>\n\n<form id=\"reg-twice\" action=\"/order\" method=\"post\">\n  <p><label for=\"rt-mail1\">Email</label> <input id=\"rt-mail1\" name=\"buyer\" type=\"text\"></p>\n  <p><label for=\"rt-mail2\">Email for the invoice</label> <input id=\"rt-mail2\" name=\"invoice\" type=\"text\"></p>\n  <p><button type=\"submit\">Order</button></p>\n</form>\n<form id=\"confirm-twice\" action=\"/account\" method=\"post\">\n  <p><label for=\"ct-mail1\">Email</label> <input id=\"ct-mail1\" name=\"account\" type=\"text\"></p>\n  <p><label for=\"ct-mail2\">Confirm email</label> <input id=\"ct-mail2\" name=\"account-confirm\" type=\"text\"></p>\n  <p><button type=\"submit\">Create account</button></p>\n</form>\n<form id=\"same-as\" action=\"/billing\" method=\"post\">\n  <p><label for=\"sa-street1\">Street address for delivery</label> <input id=\"sa-street1\" name=\"delivery-street\" type=\"text\"></p>\n  <p><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"same\" id=\"sa-same\"> Billing address same as delivery address</label></p>\n  <p><label for=\"sa-street2\">Street address for billing</label> <input id=\"sa-street2\" name=\"billing-street\" type=\"text\"></p>\n  <p><button type=\"submit\">Next step</button></p>\n</form>\n<form id=\"ac-twice\" action=\"/gift\" method=\"post\">\n  <p><label for=\"ac-mail1\">Email</label> <input id=\"ac-mail1\" name=\"sender\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></p>\n  <p><label for=\"ac-mail2\">Email for the receipt</label> <input id=\"ac-mail2\" name=\"receipt\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></p>\n  <p><button type=\"submit\">Send gift</button></p>\n</form>\n<form id=\"single-mail\" action=\"/quote\" method=\"post\">\n  <p><label for=\"sm-mail\">Email</label> <input id=\"sm-mail\" name=\"quote\" type=\"text\"></p>\n  <p><button type=\"submit\">Request quote</button></p>\n</form>\n</main>\n<footer><p>Example Shop, 2026</p></footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
      }
    }
